{"id":"7c0eb208441d0c3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-ext.md","title":"Ext","display":"df-ext — Ext","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ext","aliases":["58-df-ext"],"display":"df-ext — Ext","depends_on":["[[58-df-projective-resolution]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","[[58-df-cohomology]]","[[58-df-composite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ext"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ext</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ext — Ext"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"58-df-projective-resolution\">58-df-projective-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"58-df-cohomology\">58-df-cohomology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a8591aa671cf9030\" href=\"?note=a8591aa671cf9030\" title=\"58-df-composite\">58-df-composite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon,E\\in V\">\\(A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon,E\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"58-df-projective-resolution\">58-df-projective-resolution</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)\\)</span>, the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-module homomorphisms from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+_C,\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+_C,\\delta)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,X,Y,Z)\">\\(\\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,X,Y,Z)\\)</span> are the exact registered cohomology and typed-composition predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)\\)</span> (resolution-relative presentation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext\\text{-}hom} \\vdash \\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in B^U:\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext\\text{-}hom} \\vdash \\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in B^U:\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C,+_C,\\delta\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;C(q)=\\operatorname{Hom}_R(P(q),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega\\;C(q)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C(q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\bigl(\\delta(q)(f),f,d(q+1),P(q+1),P(q),B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(E,n;C,+_C,\\delta)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C,+_C,\\delta\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;C(q)=\\operatorname{Hom}_R(P(q),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega\\;C(q)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C(q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\bigl(\\delta(q)(f),f,d(q+1),P(q+1),P(q),B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(E,n;C,+_C,\\delta)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation keeps the ring, resolution, augmentation, differential, and full <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>-indexed cochain complex explicit.  Precomposition is expressed by the registered six-place composite relation, and the output is tied to the registered cohomology object rather than to an unbound notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^n(K,\\delta)\">\\(H^n(K,\\delta)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Independence of the chosen projective resolution is a downstream theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-projective-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cohomology","status":"resolved","id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cohomology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-composite","status":"resolved","id":"a8591aa671cf9030","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-composite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)$ (see [[58-df-projective-resolution]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+_C,\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,X,Y,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext\\text{-}hom} \\vdash \\operatorname{Hom}_R(U,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in B^U:\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{ExtResolution}_S(E,n,A,B,R,P,d,\\varepsilon)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C,+_C,\\delta\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;C(q)=\\operatorname{Hom}_R(P(q),B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega\\;C(q)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in C(q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\bigl(\\delta(q)(f),f,d(q+1),P(q+1),P(q),B\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(E,n;C,+_C,\\delta)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"H^n(K,\\delta)","display":false}],"bytes":2092,"backlinks":[{"id":"12ff4099e35b4ab6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-507","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ext.md|58-df-ext]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a1ff59b2909a8ac7","25e593b1b8714c23","03f2d34d9851bee4","a8591aa671cf9030"]}